      <title>Linux 7.3内核调度器升级，低功耗PC游戏性能提升</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260819/Linux-7.3%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E8%B0%83%E5%BA%A6%E5%99%A8%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E4%BD%8E%E5%8A%9F%E8%80%97PC%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87/</link>
